# Captures are regenerated by the game itself on demand. Committing them would
# put a few hundred kilobytes of PNG into history every iteration for no gain —
# the baselines that ARE reference material live in evidence/baseline/ and are
# committed deliberately.
evidence/*.png
evidence/*.json
!evidence/baseline/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
